acceptance_criteria: Identify the exact failing test or infrastructure condition from the run logs; reproduce with a Windows-equivalent contract; fix product or harness without weakening the gate; rerun the full nightly matrix green and link exact-head evidence.
parent: pm-wo8
severity: high
repro_steps: "Inspect https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/actions/runs/32447807398 and reproduce its windows-latest Node 24 job at exact main SHA 3e7ac007725f6d2262407a56ac92e2d9e82838df."
resolution: "Made search tracker fixtures host-path-native, reinstalled filesystem doubles in the nested suite, added project-root-to-.agents/pm search integration coverage, and assigned a Windows-safe 60-second budget only to the real git-composition acceptance test."
expected_result: "All Nightly validation jobs pass on the exact fix branch, including windows-latest / Node 24, without weakening product preflight or test assertions."
actual_result: "Nightly run 32500201496 passed Ubuntu Node 22/24/25, macOS Node 24, and windows-latest Node 24; the Windows job completed successfully in 11m34s. PR #1079 exact-head checks also passed."
