comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-21T05:42:10.609Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check 2026-08-21: searched all 2,526 PM items and Windows nightly lineage for run 32447807398 and GitHub #1075; prior Windows items cover older exact failures, not this run. Source: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1075"
  "2026-08-21T15:42:09.786Z","harness:codex","Reproduction evidence 2026-08-21: exact-main manual Nightly run 32497483748 reproduced Windows Node 24 only. 65 search-command tests fail because the suite hard-codes D:\\tmp\\pm-search without initializing a tracker after fail-closed tracker preflight; context-integrity-primitives also timed out at 30s. Linux Node 22/24/25 and macOS Node 24 passed. Proceeding with harness-only repair; product preflight remains unchanged."
  "2026-08-21T15:44:24.766Z","harness:codex","TDD green step: focused Linux verification passes 2 files / 98 tests. The red evidence is exact Windows Nightly runs 32447807398 and 32497483748; the fix resolves fixture roots with path.resolve in both suites and raises only the real git-composition test budget to 60s."
  "2026-08-21T15:54:29.116Z","harness:codex","Local pre-review evidence 2026-08-21: focused verification passes 2 files / 98 tests; full repository coverage passes 547 files / 7,681 tests at exactly 100% statements (56,179/56,179), branches (41,937/41,937), functions (11,686/11,686), and lines (54,177/54,177); pnpm quality:static passes all mandatory gates. pm-changelog 2026.8.17 reports CHANGELOG.md unchanged while the item remains in progress. Hosted Windows exact-head evidence remains required before closure."
  "2026-08-21T16:08:53.318Z","harness:codex","Correction to the 2026-08-21T15:44:24.766Z TDD comment: fixture-root normalization changed only tests/unit/commands/search-command.spec.ts. tests/unit/sdk/context-integrity-primitives.spec.ts changed only the real git-composition test timeout from the default 30 seconds to 60 seconds; its fixture roots and assertions were unchanged. This later mutation preserves the original hash-chained event while correcting its wording."
  "2026-08-21T16:11:10.515Z","harness:codex","Hosted acceptance evidence: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/actions/runs/32500201496 passed all five Nightly jobs at PR #1079 head 9a0fabe362276f0d92745003eae0a824614cc908. Windows Node 24 passed in 11m34s; Ubuntu Node 22/24/25 and macOS Node 24 also passed. The PR's full exact-head checks passed, including Windows regression, four coverage shards plus aggregate 100% gate, static, smokes, compatibility, CodeQL, Trivy, TruffleHog, Semgrep, ShellCheck, PSScriptAnalyzer, actionlint, Codecov, and CodSpeed."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-21T16:11:11.010Z","harness:codex","Cross-platform command tests that mock fail-closed filesystem preflight must normalize fixture roots through node:path and exercise both direct tracker-root and explicit project-root-to-.agents/pm resolution. Real git-composition acceptance tests need an explicit CI-platform time budget while keeping assertions unchanged."
